============================================================================================
S15 READING
============================================================================================
1. OCF is canonically the hard-core partition function at activity 2, or a p=2/3 independent-set density after multiplying by 3^m.
2. It is not determined by a nontrivial two-copy noise stability at rho<1; that needs a pair spectrum of independent packet pairs.
3. The forbidden values {7,21} become forbidden compatible Condorcet-cyclicity spectra alpha, because majority tournaments range over all tournaments with enough voters.
4. The LRC support-six tail should imitate the successful part: retain the finite packet address, then bound the signed compatible sum. HYP-2617 supplies the 159-class address table.
5. For LRC(14), this points to a next computation: classify which non-null coimage classes can still occur after height-1/height-2 wall deletion, rather than improving the raw absolute Minkowski volume.
